.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vercel
.env*

# Large media never belongs in this repo — assets/*.mp4 routes into Git LFS
# and these would exhaust the quota. Everything below now lives in Cloudflare
# R2 under the flight-simulation/ prefix instead; the app streams the video
# from there via /api/garden-video (see GARDEN_VIDEO_URL in main.js).
#
#   flight-simulation/4k_render_final_001.mp4          the 4K garden master
#   flight-simulation/source/ASAS0063_source_frames.zip  butterfly frames
#
# The ASAS0063 frames are the source that assets/butterfly_atlas.webp — the
# packed atlas the app actually loads — was derived from. They are only
# needed to re-pack the atlas.
assets/*.mp4
assets/ASAS0063/
